  <div class="legal-content">
    <div class="legal-section" id="window">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc1">1. Cancellation Window</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body1">Tickets can be cancelled up to 4 hours before scheduled departure through your booking confirmation or by contacting support.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="refund-amount">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc2">2. Refund Amount</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body2">The refund amount is based on the time remaining before scheduled departure:</p>
      <table class="legal-refund-table"><thead><tr><th data-i18n="legal.cancellation.tableTime">Cancellation Time</th><th data-i18n="legal.cancellation.tableRefund">Refund</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="प्रस्थान से 4 घंटे से अधिक पहले">More than 4 hours before departure</td><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="100% रिफंड">100% Refund</td></tr><tr><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="प्रस्थान से 2–4 घंटे पहले">Between 2–4 hours before departure</td><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="100% रिफंड">100% Refund</td></tr><tr><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="प्रस्थान से 30 मिनट–2 घंटे पहले">Between 30 minutes–2 hours before departure</td><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="50% रिफंड">50% Refund</td></tr><tr><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="प्रस्थान के 30 मिनट के भीतर">Within 30 minutes of departure</td><td data-i18n-swap="text" data-hi-text="0% रिफंड">0% Refund</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="process">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc3">3. How to Cancel</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body3">Cancel your ticket online via the booking confirmation link sent by email/SMS, or call our support line with your PNR/ticket number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="timelines">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc4">4. Refund Timelines</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body4">Approved refunds are processed to the original payment method within 5-7 business days, depending on your bank or payment provider.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="no-show">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc5">5. No-Show Policy</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body5">Passengers who do not board at departure without prior cancellation are considered a no-show and are not eligible for any refund.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="reschedule">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc6">6. Rescheduling</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body6">Date or route changes are treated as a cancellation and new booking, subject to seat availability and the applicable cancellation charges above.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="tours-cancel">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.cancellation.toc7">7. Tours &amp; Charters</h2>
      <p data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body7">Charter and tour bookings follow custom cancellation terms agreed at the time of booking, as they involve advance vehicle reservation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-section" id="contact-us">
      <h2 data-i18n="legal.terms.toc8">8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p><span data-i18n="legal.cancellation.body8Prefix">For cancellations or refund queries, contact us at</span> <a href="mailto:support@mahaveerbusservice.com">support@mahaveerbusservice.com</a> <span data-i18n="legal.or">or</span> <a href="tel:+919829372120">+91 8740004790</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

